OL,3,GNEWSATeenager, 17, charged with
OL,4,Aterrorism offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager from Dundee has appeared in
OL,7,Fcourt charged with terrorism offences.
OL,9,FThe 17-year-old, who cannot be named
OL,10,Fdue to his age, faced four charges of
OL,11,Fpossessing, collecting or making a
OL,12,Fdocument likely to be useful to a
OL,13,Fperson committing or preparing an act
OL,14,Fof terrorism.
OL,16,FHe also faces another charge of
OL,17,Fdisseminating terrorism material.
OL,19,FThe teenager made no plea during an
OL,20,Finitial appearance at Dundee Sheriff
OL,21,FCourt. He was granted bail and the case
OL,22,Fwas committed for further examination.
